00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:51.885
Get ready for one hot, 

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.636
streaming, 

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.721
summer.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:11.821
I was wondering
where these two got off to.

